Vendor firmware the StarFive JH7110 needs, installed into /boot/firmware
where firmware(9) will find it:

  rgx.fw.*  rgx.sh.*     Imagination PowerVR Rogue DDK 1.19 -- the firmware the
                         GPU internal core runs, and the transfer shader image
  wave511_dec_fw.bin     Chips&Media Wave511 video decoder

The bootloader images in the distfile are not installed; writing those is a
separate operation and is not currently possible from FreeBSD.
